---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Engineering Disclaimer" description="Engineering and safety disclaimer for Hydraulic Toolbox calculators and technical reference content.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Safety</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.7rem);margin-top:12px">Engineering disclaimer</h1><p class="lead">The tools provide reference calculations, not equipment approval or a substitute for manufacturer documentation and competent engineering review.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section compact"><div class="container article"><p>Hydraulic systems can store and transmit dangerous energy. Calculated values are theoretical unless explicitly stated otherwise. Always verify pressure ratings, flow limits, temperature, materials, failure modes, safety factors, standards and machine-specific requirements before installation or operation.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
